BT /F1 11 Tf 60 760 Td 15 TL (I cleaned 14,200 appointment records from the two practices in Python with pandas.) Tj T* (Each appointment was assigned to the 24-hour or the 3-hour reminder at random.) Tj T* (I fitted a logistic regression with age group and practice as controls.) Tj T* (The practice manager checked the extract before it left the surgery.) Tj T* ET
